    "why_a_set_differs_from_the_step_e_record": "The step E record, data/frozen/design_support.json, was written before the ownership repair of 2026-11-19 (D-58 rule 2.2 read year by year: an investor-owned candidate is barred for an investor-owned host when some year of the host's window has no ownership row covering the candidate). The repair left the headline set, the set with the ten-year case and the set with unsettled hosts put back unchanged, so their hashes here equal the step E record's. In every cohort utility as built it replaced eight matches of three hosts (Commonwealth Edison, Ohio Power and NSTAR), so that set's weights are computed on a different design from the one the step E record describes, and its hash here does not equal the step E record's. It equals the current design summary's. The step E record is kept as it is; it is not rewritten to agree.",
